  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Presentation av genomlysning av 7 utv&#xE4;rderingar samt ARTF-genomlysning vid Development Talks 11 juni 2015. Paneldebatt &#xE4;ger &#xE4;ven rum d&#xE4;r Sidas samlade utvecklingssamarbete med Afgghanistan diskuteras.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Presentation of a review of seven evaluations made in Afghanistan, as well as a desk review of ARTF. This is rpesented at Development Talks 11th of June 2015 at Sida HQ. A panel debate will be held where Sidas&apos;s development cooperation with Afghanistan over time is discussed.</narrative>
